  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nPlease update the Python version in your Docker container releases to at least Python 3.10 or higher.\r\n\r\nI suffer from people who register on my public server, I would like to trace their IP addresses. See also: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/12014#issuecomment-1043143104\r\n\r\nHowever, I'm using the Synapse Docker image.\r\n\r\n**Latest version:** Python 3.10.5\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks in advance.",
